% F39-FSUNDER: DEFECT 39.  FLOAT-STACK UNDERFLOW WAS NOT CAUGHT: .= ON AN
% EMPTY FS PRINTED NULS (FOR$CVT_D_TG HID THE ACCVIO) AND A LATER LINE
% FAULTED.  THE PATCHED .= CHECKS, AND SO DOES THE OUTER LOOP AFTER EACH
% LINE.
FLOAT< DECIMAL
"EMPTY .=   " MSG .= CR
"NEXT       " MSG 2.5 .= CR
"DROP ALONE " MSG .DROP CR
"NEXT       " MSG 3.5 .= CR
"BALANCED   " MSG 1.5 2.5 .+ .= CR
"F_STACK    " MSG F_STACK @ <#> TYPE CR
>
